WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
A rate cut. An equity rally? There is no automatic link.

00:06.000 --> 00:12.000
Two channels. Opposing forces. Lower rates can help valuations. Weak demand can hurt earnings.

00:12.000 --> 00:18.000
June 2024: different decisions. ECB cut. Fed held. That is a starting point, not a signal.

00:18.000 --> 00:24.000
Ask why. Then ask what’s already priced in. Read the historical case. Test the explanation.
